Addresses feedback from #38 where `role="button"` and `tabindex="0"` made the bulk options button keyboard-focusable, but the JavaScript only handled click events.

## Changes

- Added `keydown` event handler for `.ezd-admin-bulk-options` to respond to Enter and Space keys
- Handler triggers existing click behavior via `$(this).click()`
- Prevents default to avoid page scrolling on Space press
- Supports both `' '` and `'Space'` key values for browser compatibility

## Implementation

```javascript
// Keyboard accessibility for bulk options button
$('.ezd-admin-bulk-options').keydown(function (e) {
    if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'Space') {
        e.preventDefault();
        $(this).click();
    }
});
```

