## Root Cause

In `src/components/Export/MasterMerge.jsx`, the issue is on **line 67**:

```javascript
const newPageIndex = totalPageOffset + targetIdx;
const newPage = mergedPdf.getPage(newPageIndex);
destArray[0] = newPage.ref;
